    turnFlow: "1. **Draw**: Start your turn by taking one card from the stock or the top of the discard pile. 2. **Meld** (optional): Lay one or more valid combinations face upâ€”sets (3â€“4 of a rank) or runs (3+ consecutive in suit). 3. **Lay off** (optional): Add cards to your own or others' melds. 4. **Discard**: End your turn by placing one card face-up on the discard pile. If you drew from the discard, you cannot discard that same card to leave the pile unchanged. 5. **Going out**: First to meld, lay off, or discard away all cards wins the hand. Play stops immediately.",
